  <!-- 🔴 BLOCKED — DO NOT START. The owner's question was formally put on 2026-09-18 and is UNDECIDED.
       ⚠️ STUB — PREMISES NOT YET VERIFIED. Author with /task-create AFTER the decision, and have it
